     "body": "<p>As of <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/migration-utils/commit/25cdf92975afc8b7dda740fb1d4ffbc8df16a226\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/migration-utils/commit/25cdf92975afc8b7dda740fb1d4ffbc8df16a226</a></p>\n\n<p>I can get to 150 levels deep.</p>\n<blockquote><p>r = <a href=\"http://localhost:\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>Before I get a 500 Server Error because </p>\n<blockquote><p>Value too long for column \"FEDORA_ID VARCHAR(503)</p></blockquote>\n<p>That is a problem (one I think we have discussed with having a single table to hold the Fedora IDs and have all other tables reference it and use a shorter hash internally), but its not this problem.</p>",
