  "description": "<p>This bug can be observed by running the following script:<br/>\n```<br/>\n#!/usr/bin/bash</p>\n\n<p>x=0; <br/>\nr=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/\"; <br/>\nwhile true; <br/>\n  do x=$(($x + 1));<br/>\n  r=`curl -s -H\"Slug: $x\" -XPOST $r`; <br/>\n  echo \"r = $r\"; <br/>\ndone <br/>\n```</p>\n\n<p>We will likely want to catch PersistentStorageExceptions and send an appropriate response code to the client... instead of a stacktrace.</p>",
